// Joukahainen of the game's own). The torpedo boats are invented; the destroyers are Wrangel-likes (Hugin and Munin of
// the older class among them); the transports are coastal passenger steamers taken up (13 kn).
// The aims (docs/battle/aims.md): Sweden's three of the four transports at Eckerö, lying off it 90 minutes while the
// troops go ashore; Finland's to stop them. Set for balance by the forces (the fourth Väinämöinen), the stay, the haze
// and Finland's bold doctrine (Aggression +1: the Kommodori fights down to a third of the odds and closes): as the AI
